From: Sayzal28 <Sayzal28@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:57:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] One setting picks the image models for clothes, costumes
 and race outfits

IMAGE_MODELS_CLOTHES lists the models in order: first choice, then its backups.
With no setting the list is the one the code had (four GPT Image models, then
Krea 2), so nothing changes for users. Each job keeps the list it started with:
a costume row stores it, a race outfit ticket carries it, and the try rule and
billing read the job's own list. A costume row whose first provider is no longer
the first in the code still runs (it was left waiting before). A wrong setting
stops a job from starting and names the bad id; the default is never used in
its place without saying so. Backdrops are not part of this change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
